         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">NCP785A - Linear Regulator - Wide Input Voltage Range, Ultra-Low Iq, High PSRR, 10mA</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The NCP785A is a highâˆ’performance linear regulator, offering a very wide operating input voltage range of up to 450 V DC, with an output current of up to 10 mA.&#xA;Ideal for high input voltage applications such as industrial and home metering, home appliances. The NCP785A family offers Â±5% initial accuracy, extremely highâˆ’power supply rejection ratio and ultraâˆ’low quiescent current. The NCP785A is optimized for highâˆ’voltage line and load transients, making this part ideal for harsh environment applications.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
         <xmp:CreateDate>2023-03-14T09:43:15-07:00</xmp:CreateDate>
         <xmp:CreatorTool>BroadVision, Inc.</xmp:CreatorTool>
